column110:
A small simplification/optimization:<p><pre><code>        int third = len / div;
        third=third>0?third:1;

        // "medians"
        int m1 = left  + third;
        int m2 = right - third;
</code></pre>
Instead of the worse:<p><pre><code>        int third = len / div;

        // "medians"
        int m1 = left  + third;
        int m2 = right - third;

        if (m1 <= left) {
            m1 = left + 1;
        }
        if (m2 >= right) {
            m2 = right - 1;
        }</code></pre>
